mindmap
  root(("Network Security"))
    Security Threats
      Passive Attacks
        Eavesdropping / Sniffing
        Traffic analysis
        Port scanning
      Active Attacks
        Masquerade / IP Spoofing
        Replay attack
        Message modification
        Denial of Service (DoS/DDoS)
        Man-in-the-Middle (MITM)
      Application Threats
        SQL injection
        Cross-site scripting (XSS)
        Phishing
        Malware / Ransomware
    Cryptography
      Symmetric Key
        AES (128/192/256-bit)
        ChaCha20 stream cipher
        Modes: ECB, CBC, CTR, GCM
        Fast, shared secret key
      Asymmetric Key
        RSA (2048/4096-bit)
        Elliptic Curve (ECC/ECDH)
        Diffie-Hellman key exchange
        Key pairs: public + private
      Hash Functions
        SHA-256 / SHA-3
        Preimage & collision resistance
        HMAC for message authentication
      Digital Signatures
        Sign with private key
        Verify with public key
        ECDSA, RSA-PSS
    Security Protocols
      TLS / SSL
        Handshake: ClientHello → ServerHello
        Certificate verification
        Key exchange (ECDHE)
        Record protocol encryption
        TLS 1.3: 1-RTT, 0-RTT resumption
      IPSec
        Transport mode (payload only)
        Tunnel mode (entire packet)
        AH (authentication)
        ESP (encryption + auth)
        IKE key establishment
      VPN
        Site-to-site IPSec VPN
        Remote-access SSL VPN
        WireGuard (modern, fast)
    Firewalls
      Packet Filter
        Stateless: IP, port, protocol
        Simple, fast, low security
      Stateful
        Tracks connection state table
        Allows return traffic automatically
      Application / NGFW
        Deep packet inspection
        Application identification
        TLS decryption proxy
        IDS/IPS integration
    PKI & Identity
      X.509 Certificates
        Subject, issuer, validity
        Public key binding
      Certificate Authority
        Root CA (self-signed, trusted)
        Intermediate CA
        End-entity certificates
      Certificate Validation
        Chain of trust up to root
        CRL / OCSP revocation
        Certificate Transparency logs